  '00000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000030b',
  '00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000031',
  'quant-12-vectorising-with-cumsum',
  E'Vectorising with cumsum',
  E'Yesterday''s double-loop ran in 28 minutes. Your manager wants the same answer in 8 seconds before tomorrow''s standup. The cumulative-sum identity `c[i] − c[i−w]` is the canonical trick — every senior quant carries it in their head; pandas, vectorbt, and every market-data smoother use it internally. Today you build it from the function signature.',
